 "stimulus_html": "<p>The regression equation used to predict average monthly faculty salary (FacSal) from out-of-state tuition (OutState) using the data in <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/Chapter8_Data-Sets\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">“TNSchools”</a> is <span data-math=\"y = 0.161{\\text{ }}x + 2645\">y = 0.161{\\text{ }}x + 2645</span></p>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 528845,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Predict the average monthly faculty salary for a school that charges $30,000 in out-of-state tuition.\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You are given the regression equation, <span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}0.161x + {\\text{ }}2645\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}0.161\\left( {30,000} \\right){\\text{ }} + {\\text{ }}2645{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$ 7,475\"></span></p>\n<p>The predicted average monthly faculty salary is $7,475.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>$7,475</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 528846,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Maryville College charges $34,880 for out-of-state students, and their average monthly faculty salary is $6,765. Do they pay faculty more or less than expected? By how much?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You are given the regression equation, <span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}0.161x + {\\text{ }}2645\"></span></p>\n<p>Substitute $34,880 for <i>x</i> and compare the result to $6,765.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}0.161\\left( {34,880} \\right){\\text{ }} + {\\text{ }}2,645{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$ 8.260.68\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"8,260.68{\\text{ }} - {\\text{ }}6,765{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}1,495.68\"></span></p>\n<p>The actual $6,765 salary is $1,495.68 less than the predicted salary.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>Less than expected by $1,495.68</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 528847,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Write a sentence to interpret the slope.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The regression equation is <span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}0.161x + {\\text{ }}2645\"></span></p>\n<p>The slope is 0.161.</p>\n<p>This tells you that for every $1,000 increase in out-of-state tuition, you expect the average monthly faculty salary to increase by $161.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>For every $1,000 increase in out-of-state tuition, we expect average monthly salary to increase by $161.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
